    "detailed_description": "<i>New Year's Eve 2020</i> is the only real time New Year's Eve simulator to this day, its unique internal mechanism and achievements will be your wonderful memory of 2020 New Year.<br><br>  This game can implement the countdown program by analysing the actual time of your area. Before the fireworks start on New Year's Eve you are allowed to immerse in simulative natural environment which has realistic day and night, weather system liberally.<br><br><strong>Note:</strong><i>New Year's Eve 2020</i> is a time-based game. Actually, if you buy it after New Year's Eve the countdown program will stop working.(If you don't want to change the system date on your computer)<br><br><br>Main functions,<br>  enjoying New Year's Eve and unlocking the achievement as a memento<br>  New Year countdown and fireworks<br>  Christmas special content<br>  realistic weather effects help you release pressure<br>  stimulative piano and meditation<br>  considering the past<br>  making you feel comfortable",
